   201	def printed_beside(readings, per_counting):
   202	    """The rule's printed-beside quantities that come from the cards (DESIGN-1.6.md §0, §4): D428's limits, the sign test, the floors and
   203	    the days from a matter's first article to its opening. None of them enters the verdict."""
