V5 answers the round-six design points. Scan hits now require full-context adjudication, the dossier renderings go to separate sessions, and the July 14 selection includes closed views. Eligibility retains finished-draw fingerprints after a stop. The D400 code check verifies all three pass files and leaves a skipped ladder unmeasured. D428’s sample label and insufficient count are wired. [V5](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/research/2026-11-17-product-comparison/DESIGN-1.6.md:65) · [Eligibility](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/research/2026-11-17-product-comparison/stage0/eligibility.py:112) · [D400 check](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/research/2026-11-17-product-comparison/stage0/d400_code_check.py:23) · [D428 report](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/research/2026-11-17-product-comparison/stage0/score_comparison.py:201)

- **The support floor can pass on unresolved answers.** In a synthetic draw, eight supported answers, one split and one unsupported answer produced a 9/10 pass in the favoured counting. The cited proposal keeps unresolved answers in the denominator without credit. Apply that rule to the floor and preserve the frozen split treatment for the verdict. [Floor code](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/research/2026-11-17-product-comparison/stage0/score_comparison.py:232) · [Proposal](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/research/2026-11-14-use-acceptance/reflection-10/codex-1.md:31)
- **Opening dates silently omit split-only coverage.** The coverage floor credits it in the favoured counting, while the opening report drops it. Print opening dates per counting or label the report as confirmed coverage only. [Opening report](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/research/2026-11-17-product-comparison/stage0/score_comparison.py:293)
- **Two inputs still need wiring.** Fingerprint `cases.json`, which supplies the thesis and article that D400 readers see. Give finished draws a diagnostic-only export path. The existing exporter rejects an ineligible aggregate before producing any cards. Keep the six-draw release check intact. [Input list](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/research/2026-11-17-product-comparison/stage0/eligibility.py:86) · [D400 packet builder](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/clean-arch/step4-2026-11-10/stage_a/build_reader_packets.py:30) · [Exporter](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/research/2026-11-17-product-comparison/stage0/mapping.py:157)

CHANGE: withhold support-floor credit for unresolved answers, specify opening-date coverage, fingerprint D400 cases, and wire diagnostic export.
